[
  {
    "text": "日常生活的织锦",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.10071910091700689,
      "left": 0.3627450829248366,
      "width": 0.27450980620914983,
      "height": 0.030303029040404043
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "每个星期六早上6点30分,第一批顾客还",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3490195793300659,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "没到,河湾市场的摊主们就已经开始卸货",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35294117941176406,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "了。这个市场自1948年起就开在杨树街的",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2099239377493811,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3568822694436302,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "四个街区上,据老街坊说,七十多年来从",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2326512095296841,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35294117941176406,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "未停过一个星期。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2553784813099871,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.15686274640522851,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "如今这里大约有140个摊位,而十年前只",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3451176005710798,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "有85个。根据市政府2023年的调查,市",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3131436304182573,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.345097963562094,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "场在普通周末能吸引约12000名顾客,每",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3358709021985603,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3490391425645449,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年为本地经济带来约420万元的收入(周",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35859817397886334,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3490195790849678,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "边的咖啡馆和小店还不算在内)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3813254457591663,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2745098062091499,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3813254457591663,
      "left": 0.38725489268790825,
      "width": 0.014705875857843326,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "“大家都以为我们卖的是蔬菜,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4173102927446461,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.265431368352124,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”在这里摆",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4173102927446461,
      "left": 0.3781764553210784,
      "width": 0.08405881169362772,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "了27年菜摊的王秀兰说,“其实我们卖的",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4400375645249492,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.34674504768464187,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "是一个让人愿意进城的理由。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.46276483630525217,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.25490196290849626,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”她说,卖得",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.46276483630525217,
      "left": 0.3676470498774508,
      "width": 0.10366663367075267,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "最好",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.48549210808555515,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.03921568660130712,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的还是两块钱一袋的什锦青菜。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.48549210808555515,
      "left": 0.15686274052287574,
      "width": 0.2745098062091499,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数据也印证了她",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5205299854135224,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1372549031045749,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的说法。赶集日的人流量",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5205299854135224,
      "left": 0.2549019570261436,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "比其他星期六高出38%,四分之三的顾客",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5432572571938254,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35627446701797505,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "表示,他们还顺便去了附近的其他店铺。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5659845289741284,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35294117941176406,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "省立大学的经济学家李明教授把这种现象",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5887118007544315,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35294117941176406,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "称",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6114390725347345,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.01960784330065356,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "为“溢出效应”。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6114390725347345,
      "left": 0.13725489722222217,
      "width": 0.13870586431862791,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "当然,问题也不少。今年1月,摊位费从每",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6464769498627017,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.360803901142974,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "天35元涨到了50元,几位老摊主说这笔开",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6692042216430049,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3607842648692825,
      "height": 0.015151514520201985
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "销很难承受。停车依然是最常见的抱怨:",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6919314934233078,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35294117941176406,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "最近的公共停车场只有220个车位,通常",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7146587652036108,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.34901957785947774,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "上午9点15分之前就停满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7373860369839138,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.24707838823447847,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市议会正在考虑一项提案,计划在5月1日",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7733708839693937,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3529607587001639,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "至10月31日期间再封闭两个街区,禁止车",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7960981557496967,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35298033222876013,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "辆通行。支持者认为这样可以多容纳40个",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8188254275299996,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3568627141748372,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "摊位;反对者则担心送货不便,也担心老",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8415526993103027,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35294117941176406,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年居民出行困难。不少年轻人习惯用手机",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3529411794117634,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "App付款,摊主们也陆续贴出了二维码。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.34958820822794123,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "眼下,一切照旧。到了中午,面包已经卖",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2222345432970452,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3529411794117634,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "光,花桶空了一半,喷泉旁边有一支铜管",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2449618150773482,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3529411794117634,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "乐队在演奏(五位退休教师,自称“第二",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2676890868576512,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3438627479635609,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "春”)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.049745090819444567,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。下午2点,卡车又重新装满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.5644509512361114,
      "width": 0.2813725365604569,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "关于封路计划的公开听证会定于3月14日",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.32640120562343405,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3451175919926488,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "星期四晚上7点在市政厅204室举行。书面",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.34912847740373704,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.35974505412826874,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "意见可在本月底之前寄送至秘书处。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3718557491840401,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.31372549281045636,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
